---
export const prerender = true;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>CameraBoss content dashboard</title>
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.cameraboss.co.uk/admin/" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p class="brand">CAMERABOSS</p>
      <h1>Content dashboard</h1>
      <p>Write blog posts and manage page SEO through Pages CMS. Sign in with the email address invited by the CameraBoss owner.</p>
      <a class="button" href="https://app.pagescms.org/">Open content editor</a>
      <p class="note">For existing pages, choose “Existing pages &amp; articles — SEO”. For a new article, choose “Blog posts — new articles”. Save an SEO edit to publish it. For a new article, enable Published and save.</p>
      <p class="note">Updates appear automatically after a successful website build. Keep existing URLs unchanged. If access is unavailable, the owner must first connect Pages CMS and invite your email.</p>
      <a class="back" href="/">Return to the website</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  :global(body){margin:0;background:#fff;color:#171717;font:16px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif}
  main{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;padding:80px 24px}
  .brand{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px}h1{font-size:44px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-1.5px;margin:32px 0 24px}
  p{color:#555}.button{display:inline-block;background:#171717;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 22px;margin:16px 0 22px;font-weight:700}
  .note{font-size:14px}.back{display:inline-block;color:#171717;margin-top:25px;font-size:14px;text-underline-offset:4px}
  a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b52532;outline-offset:4px}
</style>
